        "content": "## Alpha Research - Web Scraping Dispatcher\n\n**Workflow 1 of 2** | Pipelines 1 + 2\n\nScheduled batch dispatcher that reads 300+ companies from Google Sheets, scrapes investor relations pages, uses Claude AI to extract and classify financial document links, deduplicates, and stores documents in cloud storage.\n\n**Setup:** Add Google Sheets + Google Drive + Anthropic credentials. Configure sheet ID in 'Read Company Registry' node.\n\n**Schedule:** Default daily. Change in 'Daily Schedule' trigger node.",
